Z||000000||84_duke||10-26-2001||03:18 PM||||Alright, I was considering doing a 2.8 swap into my 84, but I thought of another possibility that might be less complicated and kind of unique.  What is the most HP that you guys have seen from a duke?  I was thinking along the lines of new performanc plugs, wires, ignition coil, air filter, performance cams, lifters and pistons from the fiero store, plus a high flow cat and exhaust system.  The car a 4speed in it and the engine could use a rebuild anyways if I am going to keep it in the car.  Would doing this bring the car into the HP range of a stock 2.8? Thanks<P>------------------<BR>84_duke||||reg||5
