Z||000009||johnt671||10-26-2001||07:08 PM||||See, I told you.  If you read through the old posts you will find some advise between the crap.  I've put in a K&N air filter, MSD GM blaster coil and control system, and 8mm Accel plug wires in mine. Made a difference in the car(84 SE) over 3000 rpms.  Drawback is that the MSD coil died after 6 months.  Car ran nice though.  Plan to replace the original cat with a Rodney Dickman cat and some other minor improvements, but I,ve been laid off so I'll have to wait.  I know there is a lot you can get to improve the duke, as headers, cams, and headwork have all been mentioned in other threads||||reg||1
