Z||000015||Return of Fiero||10-27-2001||04:02 PM||||tec 4 is the same as the "duke" as its being called? amazing, not venting or gettting worked up. really i could give a crap, but the 88' kept some good time against quite a few cars on the strip in machester ("manch vagas" to the locals) dont know why everyone knocks the 4cy, with a few upgrades, im sure they would be nice for a bit of power. i know that i had a 4 that was pretty fast, and the people who have talked to me a bit about it know it would waste any 6 Fiero upgraded or not. want to know how? contact me outside of the forum, or in a private message, i dont think i need to put yet another 70 line post in here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Myke<BR>(NH fireo divers who know me, they have been told  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )||||reg||1
